{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"itemBody\">\n<p class=\"itemFullText\">\r\n\t\t\t醫管局宣布，因天文台已發出八號或以上熱帶氣旋警告信號，轄下所有家庭醫學診所暫停服務；公立醫院的急症室則維持正常服務。\t\t</p>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T23:38:45.714409+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":58,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none"}}